				{
					"name": "Export Data (GDPR)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{token}}",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/export",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"auth",
								"export"
							]
						},
						"description": "Auth-owned, Auth-orchestrated GDPR data portability export ([[api_profile_export]], [[rule_gdpr_compliance]], [[upsilonauth:service_gdpr_export_orchestrator]]).\n\nOn success (200), returns the standard success envelope whose `data` is `authv1.GDPRExport`: `schema_version`, `generated_at` (RFC3339 UTC), `complete` (always true on 200 — there is no partial success), `included_fragments` (ordered `[\"auth\",\"economy\"]`, plus `\"tactical\"` only when the caller is enrolled), `auth` (account/registrations/tokens, no internal UUID, no credentials), `economy` (wallet/inventory/ledgers), and `tactical` — omitted entirely (no key at all) when the caller is not enrolled in tactical. The response carries `Content-Disposition: attachment; filename=\"upsilon_identity_export.json\"`.\n\nOn any incomplete fragment collection, returns 503 with the standard error envelope (`data: null`, no attachment header) and `meta: {reason: \"export_incomplete\", missing_fragments: [{name, reason}]}`. A 200 always means a complete export."
					},
					"response": [
						{
							"name": "200 OK - Complete export (enrolled in tactical)",
							"originalRequest": {
								"method": "GET",
								"header": [
									{
										"key": "Authorization",
										"value": "Bearer {{token}}",
										"type": "text"
									}
								],
								"url": {
									"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/export",
									"host": [
										"{{baseUrl}}"
									],
									"path": [
										"auth",
										"export"
									]
								}
							},
							"status": "OK",
							"code": 200,
							"_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
							"header": [
								{
									"key": "Content-Type",
									"value": "application/json"
								},
								{
									"key": "Content-Disposition",
									"value": "attachment; filename=\"upsilon_identity_export.json\""
								}
							],
							"body": "{\n    \"request_id\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n    \"message\": \"Export generated\",\n    \"success\": true,\n    \"data\": {\n        \"schema_version\": \"authv1.gdpr-export.v1\",\n        \"generated_at\": \"2026-09-16T12:00:00Z\",\n        \"complete\": true,\n        \"included_fragments\": [\"auth\", \"economy\", \"tactical\"],\n        \"auth\": {\n            \"account\": {\n                \"account_name\": \"example_user\",\n                \"email\": \"example_user@example.com\",\n                \"role\": \"player\",\n                \"full_address\": null,\n                \"birth_date\": null,\n                \"created_at\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\n                \"updated_at\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\n                \"deleted_at\": null\n            },\n            \"registrations\": [],\n            \"tokens\": []\n        },\n        \"economy\": {\n            \"schema_version\": \"economyv1.gdpr-export.v1\",\n            \"wallet\": {},\n            \"inventory\": [],\n            \"credit_ledger\": [],\n            \"inventory_ledger\": []\n        },\n        \"tactical\": {}\n    },\n    \"meta\": {}\n}"
						},
						{
							"name": "503 Service Unavailable - Incomplete export",
							"originalRequest": {
								"method": "GET",
								"header": [
									{
										"key": "Authorization",
										"value": "Bearer {{token}}",
										"type": "text"
									}
								],
								"url": {
									"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/export",
									"host": [
										"{{baseUrl}}"
									],
									"path": [
										"auth",
										"export"
									]
								}
							},
							"status": "Service Unavailable",
							"code": 503,
							"_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
							"header": [
								{
									"key": "Content-Type",
									"value": "application/json"
								}
							],
							"body": "{\n    \"request_id\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n    \"message\": \"Export incomplete\",\n    \"success\": false,\n    \"data\": null,\n    \"meta\": {\n        \"reason\": \"export_incomplete\",\n        \"missing_fragments\": [\n            { \"name\": \"economy\", \"reason\": \"timeout\" }\n        ]\n    }\n}"
						}
					]
				},
